          "text": "CHAO I 趙翼 (T. 雲崧, 耘松, H. 甌北) Dec. 4, 1727–1814, June 5, historian and poet, was a native of Yang-hu, Kiangsu. His father, Chao Wei-k'uan 趙惟寬 (T. 子容, d. 1741), taught in private schools for a living.",
